; A census of the binary64 instructions in assembly text, by role: what a
; binary32 artifact built by CompCert (or any gas-syntax producer) still
; computes, converts or moves in binary64. Pure text in, counts out, for
; AArch64 and x86-64. An unknown floating-point mnemonic is an error, so a
; table that drifts from a producer fails loudly instead of undercounting.

(library
 (name asm_census)
 (libraries err_trace fmt))
